{"meta":{"id":"rose-powder-mist","category":"cosmetics/recipes","title":"로즈 파우더 수분 진정 미스트","subtitle":"(100g)","summary":"세안 직후 즉각 수분 공급용 로즈 파우더 향 미스트","tags":["미스트","장미수","히알루론산","수분"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-rosepowder","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-pink-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-pink-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-pink-50 text-pink-500 border border-pink-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-400\"></span>\n      화장품 레시피 1\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Formulation Note</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    로즈 파우더 수분 진정 미스트 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-pink-400 font-serif\">(100g)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-pink-50/50 border border-pink-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-pink-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">제품 성격:</strong> 미스트(스프레이 용기 활용)\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-400\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">효능 & 효과</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-pink-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">세안 직후 및 건조 시 피부 속 즉각 수분 공급</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3.5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-amber-900 leading-relaxed\">\n      <strong class=\"font-semibold text-amber-950\">※ 주의:</strong> <span class=\"bg-amber-100/90 text-amber-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold\">사용 전 가볍게 2~3회 흔들어(셰이킹)</span> 분사하고 두드려 흡수시켜 주세요\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-400\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">향 구성</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-pink-600 bg-pink-100/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">로즈 파우더 향 (총 1.0g)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border border-stone-200/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-600 mb-1.5 font-medium\">\n      <span>야생장미 <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">0.67g</strong></span>\n      <span class=\"text-stone-400 text-[11px]\">배합 비율 2 : 1</span>\n      <span>베이비 파우더 <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">0.33g</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex bg-stone-200\">\n      <div class=\"bg-pink-300 h-full transition-all\" style=\"width: 67%\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bg-amber-200 h-full transition-all\" style=\"width: 33%\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n  